# capability_ungranted_use — using effects without granted capability
# (README §12). Tests capability denial detection.

CapabilityUngrantedUse is project
CapabilityUngrantedUse module examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse
CapabilityUngrantedUse target console
CapabilityUngrantedUse entry main

examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse is module
examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse path examples.capabilityUngrantedUse
examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse exports main
examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse purpose "Demonstrate ungranted capability detection"
examplesCapabilityUngrantedUse invariant "Ungranted capabilities are denied"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Detect ungranted capability use"
main invariant "Capability denial works"

main let code immutable ExitCode 0
main return code
